{"artifact_version":"v001","citation":{"direct_official_source_url":"https://www.mohw.gov.tw/dl-78166-3cc0f176-f0d8-4f06-8046-b5809dd2823a.html","license_evidence_url":"https://1966.gov.tw/LTC/cp-6476-70761-207.html","official_source_page_url":"https://1966.gov.tw/LTC/cp-6455-69938-207.html","physical_page_end":1,"physical_page_start":1,"printed_page_end":null,"printed_page_start":null,"publisher":"mohw","section":"版本、流程起點與備註1","source_locator":"PDF實體頁1；版本、流程起點與備註1","storage_url":null,"title":"高負荷家庭照顧者轉介流程"},"content":{"char_count":159,"content_type":"definition","embedding_char_count":189,"embedding_text":"長照高負荷家庭照顧者轉介及服務流程｜版本、流程起點與備註1｜【流程圖正規化】長照高負荷家庭照顧者轉介及服務流程。110年5月10日制定、111年11月9日一修、112年10月17日二修、113年6月28日三修、114年9月30日四修。有長照服務需求家庭使用高負荷家庭照顧者初篩指標進行評估。備註1：服務對象如有長期照顧需求，但未經長照評估，應鼓勵民眾向長期照顧管理中心申請評估。","embedding_text_sha256":"fe56c81346eef2638e989b024b45912b604abceda05d1e9e97696b67c0600597","language":"zh-Hant","locale":"zh-TW","text":"【流程圖正規化】長照高負荷家庭照顧者轉介及服務流程。110年5月10日制定、111年11月9日一修、112年10月17日二修、113年6月28日三修、114年9月30日四修。有長照服務需求家庭使用高負荷家庭照顧者初篩指標進行評估。備註1：服務對象如有長期照顧需求，但未經長照評估，應鼓勵民眾向長期照顧管理中心申請評估。","text_sha256":"89aabb574796bd546f97ca4359cafc7e73930213f0c19c70831adf860523638d"},"governance":{"current_status":"current","data_classification":"public","distribution_scope":"public_knowledge","embedding_status":"not_started","human_source_review":"not_completed","ingestion_status":"staging","license_status":"open","production_approved":false,"production_gate":"blocked","review_status":"needs_review","storage_target":"local_pending_upload","version_check_status":"verified_official_source"},"identity":{"chunk_file_id":"mohw_high_burden_caregiver_referral_service_flow_20250930_rag_v2_v001","chunk_id":"mohw_high_burden_caregiver_referral_service_flow_20250930_rag_v2_0001","chunk_index":1,"prior_chunk_file_id":"mohw_high_burden_caregiver_referral_service_flow_20250930_chunkset_v004","prior_chunk_id":"mohw_high_burden_caregiver_referral_service_flow_20250930_001_v004","source_id":"mohw_h