{"artifact_version":"v001","citation":{"direct_official_source_url":"https://www.mohw.gov.tw/dl-78166-3cc0f176-f0d8-4f06-8046-b5809dd2823a.html","license_evidence_url":"https://1966.gov.tw/LTC/cp-6476-70761-207.html","official_source_page_url":"https://1966.gov.tw/LTC/cp-6455-69938-207.html","physical_page_end":1,"physical_page_start":1,"printed_page_end":null,"printed_page_start":null,"publisher":"mohw","section":"轉介來源與共同彙整","source_locator":"PDF實體頁1；轉介來源與共同彙整","storage_url":null,"title":"高負荷家庭照顧者轉介流程"},"content":{"char_count":121,"content_type":"procedure","embedding_char_count":149,"embedding_text":"長照高負荷家庭照顧者轉介及服務流程｜轉介來源與共同彙整｜【流程圖正規化】轉介來源包括家照專線／失智共同照護中心或失智社區服務據點、1966專線／特約長照服務提供單位、社會安全網體系（如家防、社福、心衛、毒防中心等），以及其他社會福利單位／團體。上述來源進入共同彙整，再依被照顧者是否為長照個案分流。","embedding_text_sha256":"38affed7ae35a0e0bbf194657e99e33af3ec99a86d423a0022deb7905ad5527b","language":"zh-Hant","locale":"zh-TW","text":"【流程圖正規化】轉介來源包括家照專線／失智共同照護中心或失智社區服務據點、1966專線／特約長照服務提供單位、社會安全網體系（如家防、社福、心衛、毒防中心等），以及其他社會福利單位／團體。上述來源進入共同彙整，再依被照顧者是否為長照個案分流。","text_sha256":"571e1a054eb5631b639ee12799956bc0dde0c1dce9030919c120daf753649743"},"governance":{"current_status":"current","data_classification":"public","distribution_scope":"public_knowledge","embedding_status":"not_started","human_source_review":"not_completed","ingestion_status":"staging","license_status":"open","production_approved":false,"production_gate":"blocked","review_status":"needs_review","storage_target":"local_pending_upload","version_check_status":"verified_official_source"},"identity":{"chunk_file_id":"mohw_high_burden_caregiver_referral_service_flow_20250930_rag_v2_v001","chunk_id":"mohw_high_burden_caregiver_referral_service_flow_20250930_rag_v2_0002","chunk_index":2,"prior_chunk_file_id":"mohw_high_burden_caregiver_referral_service_flow_20250930_chunkset_v004","prior_chunk_id":"mohw_high_burden_caregiver_referral_service_flow_20250930_002_v004","source_id":"mohw_high_burden_caregiver_referral_service_flow_20250930"},"provenance":{"authority_leve