{"artifact_version":"v001","citation":{"direct_official_source_url":"https://www.mohw.gov.tw/dl-78166-3cc0f176-f0d8-4f06-8046-b5809dd2823a.html","license_evidence_url":"https://1966.gov.tw/LTC/cp-6476-70761-207.html","official_source_page_url":"https://1966.gov.tw/LTC/cp-6455-69938-207.html","physical_page_end":1,"physical_page_start":1,"printed_page_end":null,"printed_page_start":null,"publisher":"mohw","section":"長照個案狀態與失能評估","source_locator":"PDF實體頁1；長照個案狀態與失能評估","storage_url":null,"title":"高負荷家庭照顧者轉介流程"},"content":{"char_count":127,"content_type":"procedure","embedding_char_count":157,"embedding_text":"長照高負荷家庭照顧者轉介及服務流程｜長照個案狀態與失能評估｜【流程圖正規化】未經長照評估者進入照顧管理系統（照專→A個管），進行被照顧者長照失能等級評估；非為長照失能者轉介其他適切資源，長照失能者直接轉介家照據點。已確認為長照個案且家庭照顧者已確認符合轉介之初篩指標者，敘明轉介評估事由及服務需求，再轉介家照據點。","embedding_text_sha256":"b17e220360e4b12315a0baebdda32338ecee4ff0499621da75e7daefa74883fe","language":"zh-Hant","locale":"zh-TW","text":"【流程圖正規化】未經長照評估者進入照顧管理系統（照專→A個管），進行被照顧者長照失能等級評估；非為長照失能者轉介其他適切資源，長照失能者直接轉介家照據點。已確認為長照個案且家庭照顧者已確認符合轉介之初篩指標者，敘明轉介評估事由及服務需求，再轉介家照據點。","text_sha256":"d73d769244c65228da8c51fd02f2e33d50bc505e5678368f02421f03cd19a920"},"governance":{"current_status":"current","data_classification":"public","distribution_scope":"public_knowledge","embedding_status":"not_started","human_source_review":"not_completed","ingestion_status":"staging","license_status":"open","production_approved":false,"production_gate":"blocked","review_status":"needs_review","storage_target":"local_pending_upload","version_check_status":"verified_official_source"},"identity":{"chunk_file_id":"mohw_high_burden_caregiver_referral_service_flow_20250930_rag_v2_v001","chunk_id":"mohw_high_burden_caregiver_referral_service_flow_20250930_rag_v2_0003","chunk_index":3,"prior_chunk_file_id":"mohw_high_burden_caregiver_referral_service_flow_20250930_chunkset_v004","prior_chunk_id":"mohw_high_burden_caregiver_referral_service_flow_20250930_003_v004","source_id":"mohw_high_burden_caregiver_referral_service_flow_20250930"},"provenance