{"artifact_version":"v001","citation":{"direct_official_source_url":"https://www.mohw.gov.tw/dl-78166-3cc0f176-f0d8-4f06-8046-b5809dd2823a.html","license_evidence_url":"https://1966.gov.tw/LTC/cp-6476-70761-207.html","official_source_page_url":"https://1966.gov.tw/LTC/cp-6455-69938-207.html","physical_page_end":1,"physical_page_start":1,"printed_page_end":null,"printed_page_start":null,"publisher":"mohw","section":"開案評估、14天與22點量表","source_locator":"PDF實體頁1；開案評估、14天與22點量表","storage_url":null,"title":"高負荷家庭照顧者轉介流程"},"content":{"char_count":114,"content_type":"policy","embedding_char_count":147,"embedding_text":"長照高負荷家庭照顧者轉介及服務流程｜開案評估、14天與22點量表｜【流程圖正規化】家照據點辦理評估照顧負荷與開案評估（14天）。低負荷不開案，由家照服務單位提供諮詢、轉介或其他支持性服務；中、高負荷開案並於7日內擬定服務計畫。備註5：由家照專員以照顧負荷22點量表評估中、高負荷者，則開案服務。","embedding_text_sha256":"40d00a9821bfecbcc8f4fdebbcb97ab89f91242382b5dfbadf8d4da592c05e9f","language":"zh-Hant","locale":"zh-TW","text":"【流程圖正規化】家照據點辦理評估照顧負荷與開案評估（14天）。低負荷不開案，由家照服務單位提供諮詢、轉介或其他支持性服務；中、高負荷開案並於7日內擬定服務計畫。備註5：由家照專員以照顧負荷22點量表評估中、高負荷者，則開案服務。","text_sha256":"96135cc61b3efa27fe106e203f3f267b89e5279707ca4c4c9c8ad98b12e427b5"},"governance":{"current_status":"current","data_classification":"public","distribution_scope":"public_knowledge","embedding_status":"not_started","human_source_review":"not_completed","ingestion_status":"staging","license_status":"open","production_approved":false,"production_gate":"blocked","review_status":"needs_review","storage_target":"local_pending_upload","version_check_status":"verified_official_source"},"identity":{"chunk_file_id":"mohw_high_burden_caregiver_referral_service_flow_20250930_rag_v2_v001","chunk_id":"mohw_high_burden_caregiver_referral_service_flow_20250930_rag_v2_0006","chunk_index":6,"prior_chunk_file_id":"mohw_high_burden_caregiver_referral_service_flow_20250930_chunkset_v004","prior_chunk_id":"mohw_high_burden_caregiver_referral_service_flow_20250930_006_v004","source_id":"mohw_high_burden_caregiver_referral_service_flow_20250930"},"provenance":{"authority_level"