{"artifact_version":"v001","citation":{"direct_official_source_url":"https://www.mohw.gov.tw/dl-78166-3cc0f176-f0d8-4f06-8046-b5809dd2823a.html","license_evidence_url":"https://1966.gov.tw/LTC/cp-6476-70761-207.html","official_source_page_url":"https://1966.gov.tw/LTC/cp-6455-69938-207.html","physical_page_end":1,"physical_page_start":1,"printed_page_end":null,"printed_page_start":null,"publisher":"mohw","section":"6個月複評與結案備註8","source_locator":"PDF實體頁1；6個月複評與結案備註8","storage_url":null,"title":"高負荷家庭照顧者轉介流程"},"content":{"char_count":136,"content_type":"policy","embedding_char_count":166,"embedding_text":"長照高負荷家庭照顧者轉介及服務流程｜6個月複評與結案備註8｜【流程圖正規化】個案服務6個月後，進行成效評估及照顧負荷量表複評。複評為低負荷者回到家照服務單位提供諮詢、轉介或其他支持性服務。被照顧者已使用長照資源且主要照顧者複評仍為中、高負荷者持續服務。流程節點為「結案（註8）」。備註8：結案：個案解除照顧任務或照顧負荷降為低負荷。","embedding_text_sha256":"12690429e91fa30acb06132a9cb6588fa9f62117b6cfa31b3ef5989b9fa6e515","language":"zh-Hant","locale":"zh-TW","text":"【流程圖正規化】個案服務6個月後，進行成效評估及照顧負荷量表複評。複評為低負荷者回到家照服務單位提供諮詢、轉介或其他支持性服務。被照顧者已使用長照資源且主要照顧者複評仍為中、高負荷者持續服務。流程節點為「結案（註8）」。備註8：結案：個案解除照顧任務或照顧負荷降為低負荷。","text_sha256":"28e8a49d464863d4f897e92745e765787e0922fa116dbd8bad462fe487f3c206"},"governance":{"current_status":"current","data_classification":"public","distribution_scope":"public_knowledge","embedding_status":"not_started","human_source_review":"not_completed","ingestion_status":"staging","license_status":"open","production_approved":false,"production_gate":"blocked","review_status":"needs_review","storage_target":"local_pending_upload","version_check_status":"verified_official_source"},"identity":{"chunk_file_id":"mohw_high_burden_caregiver_referral_service_flow_20250930_rag_v2_v001","chunk_id":"mohw_high_burden_caregiver_referral_service_flow_20250930_rag_v2_0008","chunk_index":8,"prior_chunk_file_id":"mohw_high_burden_caregiver_referral_service_flow_20250930_chunkset_v004","prior_chunk_id":"mohw_high_burden_caregiver_referral_service_flow_20250930_008_v004","source_id":"mohw_high_burden_caregiver_referral_service_flow_2025093